Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Mom, Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Big Brother, Middle Big Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Big Brother, Dougie, Henri, Rodney,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikey, and Little Sandra, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.26,0:01:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.88,0:01:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, I'm sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.64,0:01:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, you stayed up all night writing\Nhome to your family again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when\Nyou write to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,separately down to the last\Nlittle niece and nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least it pays off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting rave reviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call my letters the Millie Monthly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quality aside, you could have\Nwritten several books by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so weird about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you write home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, well, I used to write at\Nfirst, but it's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think for most\Npeople, that's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.55,0:02:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what would they say if I told them I\Nwas hanging out with Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you just don't want to write, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't\Nwant to write to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it sounds pretty lame to\Nsay that I just don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have accidentally\Npulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a lot of nerve,\Nyou impudent scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not dumb enough to be scared\Nby you and your rotten friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it's become clear to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of meaning\Nbehind those words, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stand up with your heads held\Nhigh and say what you want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.26,0:03:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't give up our land\Nno matter what you do to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're not going to take this anymore, and\Nyou can go back and tell that to Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said, you old geezers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gun went off by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that he mistake my\Nass you fat lift golem. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say a golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hard my pistols twitching
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how dangerous that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you make this broomhead mad,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee he'll leave you with a lot\Nmore than injuries and property damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who are dangerous,\Nclotheslining him from behind like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, that's a small\Nsacrifice for a great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you've got to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say bodyguards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two were here to protect\Nus, we'd feel a whole lot safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, thanks anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but company regulations strictly forbid\Nus from taking any part-time jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you asking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way that he moved when he pretended\Nus back there, he was exceptionally brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who this\Nbroom-head is, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, little lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only you would think\Nof using your position
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to help out people who are truly in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:05:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the situation represents the\Ncategory of risk prevention to the T
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you decided to come with us mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess something was bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all keep out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that that's our land there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is all of this here if\Nthere's no access to a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.93,0:05:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like a geo-plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a geo-plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we believe that a geo-plant ran along\Na mineral vein to form this offshoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land value has skyrocketed so high It's\Nworth as much as a ship 300 yards wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be, but it couldn't have\Ngotten this far without a lot of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would have taken a\Nmassive amount of effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.82,0:06:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago it was a tiny bud,\Nbut I couldn't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just imagining how we could\Nraise such lush, beautiful land?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On an arid planet like this, you\Nhave no idea how that kept us going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives, our dreams, and\Nour hopes are all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is amazing what you've done here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what does this have to do\Nwith you hiring bodyguards?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw what happened back there in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was not the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The landowner, Morgan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been threatening us time and\Nagain to hand over the deed or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that is all going to end tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we get this deed over to City\NHall, there's nothing he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, it's time to change ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets cold at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:07:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate all of your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we were little kids, this place\Nhas always been our playground, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and we're never gonna give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we got these two gorgeous\Ngirls tonight to keep us company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I almost wish that\Nmorning didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, what\Nhappened to that broom boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that for now we\Nshould handle this without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him to go back\Nto town in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little fight with a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Milly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to go do the rounds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.66,0:07:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Meryl, is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I know I've seen the\Nface in that picture somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing is, I\Ncan't seem to place it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean like a passing fancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A passing likeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely sure I've\Nseen that face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.84,0:08:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what a pleasant surprise,\Nthe two of you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can put your guns\Naway ladies. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come here unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to try and talk dad out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morgan means business this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk, Dad. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right the unworthy son now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason could you possibly have\Nto point a gun at your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you must know, it's their own\Nfault for not listening to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to do it or they'd\Nnever get the hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You face!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! Stop that! Millie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.00,0:09:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rotten ingrate, evil and stupid,\Ngood-for-nothing awful son! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's fighting out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Badwick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind telling me what in the\Nhell you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you guys standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't taken care of a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Badwick wanted just one more\Nchance to persuade his parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we didn't really see any\Nharm in that, so we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hired him for his diligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what's the point if he\Ncan't even kill his own parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evidently, I made an error in\Njudgment having any faith in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.84,0:10:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my car you just destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, excuse me. You probably\Ndid something crooked to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway listen Mr Morgan\Nmy father and little
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brother's bail money is\Nriding on the success of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this little scenario if\Nyou try to take it out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of our pay you're gonna\Nget yourself flattened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right\Ni can appreciate the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,value of family i didn't\Nlike that car anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great now that that's\Nsettled we'll show you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the strength of our\Nsteel-plated family bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you decided you're not going\Nto listen to me, no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will not give him the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little band of vigilantes isn't going\Nto be able to help you if you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll all be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think of Morgan as a child who wants a\Npriceless treasure he knows nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not cared for properly, this\Nland would quickly dry up and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Badwick, my son, this\Nland lives and breathes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think land is more\Nimportant than your own life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how you\Ncan so willingly continue
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to keep sacrificing everything\Nfor this land. Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.86,0:11:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He chose to die instead of being\Nraised by worthless parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.94,0:11:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was really smooth, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, place the next shot\Nabout five yards over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't hit the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see no point in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.36,0:12:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're ruining all my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patricia, Tonka-Tee, Jin-Pei, and\Nthe one that I call Miss Kanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All together, we are the totally invincible\Nteam of Marilyn, Nebraska and Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't done anything\Nso don't hog the limelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom, you're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a stick-in-the-mud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure hope that they're worth\Nall the money we're paying them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Mom, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's give Chin Pei a whirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, take aim, and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.48,0:13:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not supposed to be here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do they expect me to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's just about showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.72,0:13:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone in the right mind\Nwould just run from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That may be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom? Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.10,0:13:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and run if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't expect you to stay\Nhere and die with us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are really serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no telling\Nwhat they're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave your minds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:14:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole thing has turned into a\Nreal mess, what are we gonna do, Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, we just can't stop him! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave now and\Nthanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, have we come to an\Nunderstanding, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand what a scoundrel\Nin a pig you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, stop that. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way Morgan's\Ngoing to shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least not yet, anyway, because the\Nland would never be his without the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really that much of an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's doing it to save\Nthe land, me, and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you don't see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you've felt\Nabout your father all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure he loves you and is\Nwilling to risk his life for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's a little late\Nfor this lovey-dovey crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless we give in, Ma,\Nwe're all gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land just eats money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why it's so important to you,\Nbut it's a burden I'm willing to take on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is a new claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way out of this mess that\Nis actually worth something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fill in the amount right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is tell\Nme how many zeros you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my answer's pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want an early death, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll accommodate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the moment you do,\Nyou lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see all the\Nwitnesses standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say witnesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave a soul standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.34,0:16:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My job won't be finished here until\Nthe last man is dead, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Millie! Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but didn't your father\Never teach you that it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrong to take things that\Nbelong to someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, little lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the tough little helper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am, now you be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time, little lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter, you're all\Ndestined to become corpses anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charming as this is, I'm getting tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've heard your gruesome plan,\NI'm afraid I can't let you off that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make even the slightest twitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'll be all over you and\Nyour sick little band of thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Meryl, I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would suggest that next time you\Nthink a little bit more before you act,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie, you might live a lot longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.18,0:17:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Badwick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Badwick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it have to come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had only taken the money and sold\Nthe land, we wouldn't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one would have to die and\Nwe'd all be safe from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Millie, when you got angry\Nbefore, you were right in confronting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be outraged when\Nsomeone threatens their
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own parents and do whatever\Nwe can to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly believe that you can\Nturn the tide with those tiny terrangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, want to find out\Nwhat I can do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is if you have the guts and want\Nto risk taking a chance on the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, Morgan, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got the document!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.80,0:18:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got what you've been asking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really amazing, Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes us even now for\Nyour help on the sand steamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that all the time I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, what do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.36,0:19:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say she didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can escape the wrath\Nof Meryl's Derringers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself fortunate\Nyou're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her next targets are going to be your\Nhearts and brains, and then you're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was nothing more than a lucky shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gun couldn't possibly have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, could it have?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Supergirl technique was\Nsupposed to be totally invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.37,0:19:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hit, you blithering coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That advance payment I made you\Nwasn't cheap and I expect results!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.06,0:19:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get your act together right\Nnow, do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure cheap pay is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or of course, if your son\Nmeans that much to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't you stop throwing him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't handle any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.93,0:20:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.94,0:20:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I might have pulled something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure it will, and\Nno matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to understand it's what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to find the words to\Nthank you both for what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially you, Miss Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to share something with you from\Nan old man who raised an idiot son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone makes their own choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing could compare to the love\Nbetween a parent and a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your love for them doesn't\Nhave to be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of worrying about it, do\Nsomething more simple, yet very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk your own path with\Nyour head held high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you are who you are helps\Nthe people you love to live through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what is so\Ngreat about this stupid deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the real deed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.98,0:21:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey hold on a moment, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There seems to be one more claim transfer\Nin the envelope you need to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beneficiary, as\Nwritten here, is Badwick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mira, we're never gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time it was actually my fault\Nfor staying up all night riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dash's bus is getting ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.32,0:22:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna leave without us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.28,0:23:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,middle of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People judge people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.78,0:24:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lives are being cut short because\Nof someone's personal logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mothers, fathers, friends, their entire\Npast instantly vanishes into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, should this take\Nplace at the whim of one individual?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beautiful woman stood before the\Ncorpses of the Roderick thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me that she was merely\Ndiscarding some useless garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.50,0:24:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dominique the Cyclops told me to\Njust think of it as spring cleaning.

